<TextPage
  heading="Privacy"
  description="How Supernova collects and handles your data: what we collect, how payments and the newsletter are processed, how long we keep it, and your rights."
  lastUpdated="26 November 2026"
>
  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>Anna Ignatenko, Calle Alfaro 30, 3B, 46701 Gandia, Spain, support@supernova.is, is the data controller for personal data collected through supernova.is.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Your name and email address, when you subscribe to our newsletter, buy a product, or write to us. Nothing more.</p>

  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>Card and billing data are collected and processed by Stripe, not by us. We see only the fact and the amount of a payment, and the email address attached to it. Stripe's privacy policy is at stripe.com/privacy.</p>

  <h2>Newsletter and reader support</h2>
  <p>Our newsletter and monthly support run on Substack. Subscribing means your email address is processed by Substack under its own privacy policy, at substack.com/privacy.</p>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your data. We do not pass it to third parties for advertising. We do not run advertising on this site.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Subscriber data for as long as you are subscribed, and purchase records for as long as Spanish tax and accounting law requires.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us for a copy of your data, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to its processing — write to support@supernova.is. You can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time using the link in any email. You also have the right to complain to the Spanish data protection authority, the AEPD.</p>
</TextPage>
